Every gate in the final run, in order: the command, its real exit code, and the verdict
line each one printed, from the exact source this commit carries (`make -s clean` first).
`make check` appears last because it was invoked separately, after the suite had already
been run on its own - `make check` aborts at its `citations-check` prerequisite and never
reaches the suite in this checkout. Nothing here is a claim about firmware:
`ovmf-check`/`ovmf-test` exit 2 because this machine has no qemu-system-x86_64 and no
OVMF image at all.

